## Input and inference

Input is mono 16 kHz audio. The exact frontend uses FFT 512, hop 256, 96 Slaney
mel bins, `log10(1 + 10000 * mel)`, the published MAEST normalization, and
30-second windows centered at 20%, 50%, and 80%. Window probabilities are mean
aggregated per track. The model returns 522 multi-label logits; sigmoid is
applied exactly once by the caller.

## Training and evaluation

The extension used masked manual labels, explicit hard negatives, replay
distillation against the immutable 519-label teacher, L2-SP, and gradual
unfreezing. Uncertain annotation cells do not contribute BCE.

